 * event-interaction https://raw.githubusercontent.com/frankgoing/sub-gary/refs/heads/main/sub-fix/sub-flies-main/Qutuanmult%20x/block_check, tag=节点阻断检测, img-url=bolt.horizontal.icloud.fill.system, enabled=true
